OL,3,ANvidia launches investigation into
OL,4,ACEO's affair with suspected Chinese spy
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS tech giant Nvidia has opened an
OL,7,Findependent investigation following
OL,8,Freports its CEO Jensen Huang had a
OL,9,Frelationship with a suspected Chinese
OL,10,Fspy.
OL,12,FThe company, one of the most valuable
OL,13,Fin the world, said its board had no
OL,14,Freason to believe the company's secrets
OL,15,For national security were compromised,
OL,16,Fadding that the CEO was committed to
OL,17,Fcontinuing to lead the company.
OL,19,FSeparately, Jensen Huang admitted to
OL,20,Fhaving been "unfaithful" to his wife
OL,21,Fand apologised for hurting her and
OL,22,Ftheir children.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
